  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "るな",
    "text": "「喧しいわい、静かにせんかド阿呆。おまえらは撒き餌や、『ホワイトタイガー』を誘き寄せるための囮やで～？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "るな",
    "text": "「足長おじさん、とかの話を総合するに……。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "るな",
    "text": "「ウチらが探してる『ホワイトタイガー』は、あいかちゃんの『動物のお友達』と同じ個体である可能性が高いねん」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "るな",
    "text": "「お友達がピンチなのを見たら、」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "るな",
    "text": "「『ホワイトタイガー』があいかちゃんを救出するために姿を見せるかもしれへんやろ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 51,
    "dress": "old-s-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-s-civvies_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 452
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "るな",
    "text": "「これは、そういう作戦やで～♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 51,
    "dress": "old-s-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-s-civvies_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 452
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "るな",
    "text": "「どうも、探し回っても埒があかへんからな。誘きだす方向に、作戦を切り替えたんや。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 51,
    "dress": "old-s-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-s-civvies_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 452
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "るな",
    "text": "「うひゃひゃ、ウチの策士っぷりに全米が泣くで～？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 51,
    "dress": "old-s-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-s-civvies_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 452
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "るな",
    "text": "「あいかちゃんを吊したら、高原が文句言うかなと思って……。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "るな",
    "text": "「面倒やから、いっしょに吊したったんよ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 51,
    "dress": "old-s-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-s-civvies_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 452
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "るな",
    "text": "「お友達といっしょに吊られて、高原も本望やろ～？　往生せいや～♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 33,
    "dress": "old-member",
